        "x": 0.21899224979977872,
        "y": 0.5595703129227031
      },
      "level": 0.5595703129227031
    },
    {
      "text": "It spares no effort in cultivating the many good Filipino values",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01744185946881771,
        "width": 0.4767441749572755,
        "x": 0.2558139549244631,
        "y": 0.5813953495097772
      },
      "level": 0.5813953495097772
    },
    {
      "text": "of charity, justice, truth, honesty, decency and compassion.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.021057281643152237,
        "width": 0.4693002303441365,
        "x": 0.2207773483457748,
        "y": 0.5963770704896056
      },
      "level": 0.6003745849796438
    },
    {
      "text": "It goes to great lengths to hire the best teachers available",
